{"sourceUrl":"https://cse.csu.edu.cn/info/1040/11379.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:11.824239+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cse.csu.edu.cn/info/1040/11379.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，计算机学院决定举办</span><span>2026年暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现将开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>一、活动宗旨</span></p>\n<p><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院基本情况、师资力量、科研研究、人才培养和研究生招生政策，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></p>\n<p><span>二</span><span>、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>一</span><span>）</span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>三</span><span>）</span><span>经教育部批准具有</span><span>推免</span><span><span>资格高校的</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>届优秀本科生</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>四</span><span>）</span><span>学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>三、</span><span>申请专业</span></p>\n<p><span>081200 计算机科学与技术</span></p>\n<p><span>085400 电子信息</span></p>\n<p><span>990300 低空技术与工程</span></p>\n<p><span>四、报名时间与方式</span></p>\n<p><span>报名时间：</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>—</span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span><span>“中南大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日”网站报名，报名链接：</span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>五、活动</span><span>时间</span><span>与方式</span></p>\n<p><span>举办时间：</span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>举办方式：线上举办。</span></p>\n<p><span>六、资格审查</span></p>\n<p><span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日前完成对报名学生的报名审查，学生可通过报名网站点击</span><span>“申请状态查询”，如状态为“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得报名资格。申请状态显示为“申请信息院系审核合格”的学生</span></span><span>填写</span><span>【WPS表单】</span><span>「2026年开放日宣讲学生申报材料收集」</span><span>https://f.wps.cn/ksform/h/write/o7OroiYc/</span><span>。提交材料如下【按下列顺序将所有材料整理成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档】：</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>一</span><span>）</span><span>本人身份证和学生证；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>三</span><span>）</span><span>个人自述：含个人简历、参加本次</span><span>开放日活动</span><span>的原因、目的和期望等；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>四</span><span>）</span><span>学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（</span><span>由</span><span>所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>五</span><span>）</span><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>六</span><span>）</span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>七</span><span>）</span><span>获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>八</span><span>）</span><span>CCF-CSP认证成绩单。</span></p>\n<p><span>七、具体活动安排</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）宣讲活动</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>时间安排：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日上午</span><span>9:00-12</span><span>：</span><span>00 </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>地点：线上进行（具体安排另行通知）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span><span>会议议程：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）学院宣讲。介绍学院基本情况、科研情况、招生政策解读和人才培养情况等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）团队宣讲。介绍团队的科研、招生和人才培养情况。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>（二）师生互动</span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span><span>时间安排：</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日下午</span><span>15:00-17</span><span>：</span><span>00 </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span><span>地点：腾讯会议线上交流（另行通知）</span></span></p>\n<p><span>深入了解教师的科研、招生和人才培养情况。</span></p>\n<p><span>八、其他说明</span></p>\n<p><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加</span><span>开放日活动</span><span>资格。</span></p>\n<p><span>九、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>联系人：</span><span>雷</span><span>老师</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0731-</span></span><span>88879609  </span></p>\n<p><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>cseyb@csu.edu.cn</span></p>\n<p><span>联系地址：</span><span>湖南省长沙市岳麓区中南大学潇湘校区</span></p>\n<p><span>计算机</span><span><span>学院研究生招生</span><span>QQ群：235547302</span></span> </p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"71d6f9cc2e9348faac256f38bf9090439ab3c4b74036896ffbe5c994dcd0cda8","textLength":1271,"sourceSha256":"eba006cdd9c8f47bb348a9505ed5e23e0d47aa0d1cefe4d929193f97a3cf0de8","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-afaf2c974fda8b538a26","title":"2026年中南大学计算机学院关于举办2026年暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:11.824239+00:00"}
